The Literary Translation Archive — NOTICE
==========================================

Copyright status of displayed excerpts
--------------------------------------
This archive displays short excerpts of literary translations side by side for the
purpose of comparison, commentary, and scholarship.

- Works published before 1930, and other works whose copyright has expired, are in
  the public domain in the United States (and generally elsewhere).
- Translations published from 1930 onward are protected by copyright. The excerpts
  shown here are kept short (in practice under ~150 words each) and are included for
  noncommercial scholarly comparison under the fair use doctrine (US) and fair
  dealing (UK/EU). No full-length texts are reproduced.

